由\(B_1E_1=\dfrac{a}{4}\)，且\(E_1\)在\(A_1B_1\)上，得\(E_1=\left(\dfrac{3a}{4},0,a\right)\)；由\(D_1F_1=\dfrac{a}{4}\)，且\(F_1\)在\(D_1C_1\)上，得\(F_1=\left(\dfrac{a}{4},a,a\right)\). 于是可取\(\overrightarrow{BE_1}=\left(-\frac a4,0,a\right)\)，\(\overrightarrow{DF_1}=\left(\frac a4,0,a\right)\).
