=\frac{\overrightarrow{BE_1}\cdot\overrightarrow{DF_1}}
{|\overrightarrow{BE_1}|\,|\overrightarrow{DF_1}|}
=\frac{-\frac{a^2}{16}+a^2}
{\sqrt{\frac{a^2}{16}+a^2}\,\sqrt{\frac{a^2}{16}+a^2}}
